{"courseId":"voa-advice-preferences-b1","provider":"VOA Learning English","sourceUrl":"https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/4313171.html","attribution":"Source: VOA Learning English · Let's Learn English Level 2, Lesson 24: I Feel Super!","licenseNote":"VOA-produced Learning English content is public domain; third-party agency material is excluded.","entries":[{"id":"voa-advice-001","text":"Are you okay?","translation":"你还好吗？","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-001.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-002","text":"You'd better see a doctor.","translation":"你最好去看医生。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-002.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-003","text":"I've never felt better.","translation":"我从没感觉这么好过。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-003.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-004","text":"What are you talking about?","translation":"你在说什么？","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-004.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-005","text":"I would rather be called Lightning Bolt Lady.","translation":"我宁愿被叫作闪电女士。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-005.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-006","text":"Wait, don't tell me.","translation":"等等，别告诉我。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-006.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-007","text":"Please stop talking.","translation":"请别再说话了。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-007.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-008","text":"You really should get some help.","translation":"你真的应该寻求帮助。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-008.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-009","text":"Maybe I can become invisible.","translation":"也许我能隐形。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-009.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-010","text":"I can see you and so can everybody else.","translation":"我看得到你，其他人也看得到。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-010.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-011","text":"Maybe I can create a force field.","translation":"也许我能制造一个力场。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-011.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-012","text":"I see I have a lot of work to do.","translation":"我明白我还有很多要做。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-012.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-013","text":"You might get worse.","translation":"你的情况可能会变得更糟。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-013.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-014","text":"I'd rather go by myself.","translation":"我宁愿自己去。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-014.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-015","text":"Every time you speak, I get more confused.","translation":"你每说一句话，我就更困惑。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-015.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-016","text":"Now, stand back.","translation":"现在，退后。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-016.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-017","text":"Flying is not my superpower.","translation":"飞行不是我的超能力。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-017.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-018","text":"That's too bad.","translation":"那太糟了。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-018.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-019","text":"I'd rather walk. It's a nice day.","translation":"我宁愿走路。今天天气不错。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-019.m4a","learnable":true},{"id":"voa-advice-020","text":"I'm not talking to strangers again.","translation":"我再也不和陌生人说话了。","audio":"audio/voa-advice-preferences-b1-020.m4a","learnable":true}]}
